---
---

<section id="trust" class="bg-pine px-4 py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-page flex-col gap-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-lime"></div>
        <span class="text-label text-white">Trust & Security</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-h2 text-white">Your data stays yours, always.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-lime"></div>
          <h3 class="text-h5 text-white">Isolated deployment</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-white/70">
          Every Privaisy deployment runs on dedicated infrastructure for your organization. No shared tenancy, no cross-tenant data leakage, no outside access. Your AI operates in its own environment — completely isolated from everyone else's.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-lime"></div>
          <h3 class="text-h5 text-white">Encrypted by default</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-white/70">
          All data is encrypted at rest and in transit. Your organization holds the keys — no third-party model provider can access your prompts, documents, or outputs. We build the infrastructure; you control what goes through it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-lime"></div>
          <h3 class="text-h5 text-white">Team access controls</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-white/70">
          Role-based permissions let you decide who on your team can use the AI and what they can access. Add and remove users as your team changes — no data leaves when someone departs.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
